   "source": [
    "# Hema AI — 75k Parameter LLM Pretraining (Stage 1)\n",
    "This notebook trains the **75,000 parameter Transformer LLM** on an external GPU (Google Colab, Kaggle, or cloud CUDA instance).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Model Architecture Specs:\n",
    "- **Target Parameter Count**: ~76,576 parameters (~75k)\n",
    "- **Vocab Size**: 600 words\n",
    "- **Embedding Dimension**: 32\n",
    "- **Attention Heads**: 2\n",
    "- **Feed-Forward Hidden Dim**: 128\n",
    "- **Transformer Layers**: 3\n",
    "- **Max Sequence Length**: 256\n",
    "- **Objective**: Autoregressive Next-Token Prediction (Stage 1 Pretraining)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 1. Check GPU availability (Ensure Runtime is set to GPU: T4 / V100 / A100)\n",
    "!nvidia-smi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 2. Clone repository or navigate to workspace directory\n",
    "# If running directly inside cloned repo on Kaggle/Colab:\n",
    "import os\n",
    "if not os.path.exists('src/train.py'):\n",
    "    # If you uploaded a zip, unzip it here:\n",
    "    # !unzip -q mini_llm.zip -d mini_llm && cd mini_llm\n",
    "    print('Please ensure working directory contains src/ and data/ directories.')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Workspace ready:', os.getcwd())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 3. Install core dependencies\n",
    "!pip install torch pandas numpy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 4. Launch 75k LLM Pretraining (Stage 1)\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.environ['MODEL_PROFILE'] = '75k'\n",
    "os.environ['TRAINING_STAGE'] = '1'\n",
    "os.environ['DATASET_PATH'] = 'data/train.csv'\n",
    "\n",
    "!python3 src/train.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 5. Test generation with the newly pretrained 75k model\n",
    "!python3 src/generate.py \"hello how are you\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
